The homepage stated the thesis six ways and never let Ravikanth speak. The
identity card now carries a first-person paragraph grounded in resume facts
(15+ years, regulated financial services, context-loss failure pattern).
Removed three restatements to pay for it under the rendered budget: the hero
public-safe disclaimer (the boundary lives on /ask and in the doctrine), the
'narrow on purpose' self-description, and the field-origin duplicate of the
same failure-pattern sentence. Replaced the homepage CI-count proof item with
a pointer to /evals: the site's test suite is evidence about the site, not
about the work. Validators re-anchored to the surviving copy.
